{"completed": true, "response": "他本来就很享受和这个人自在亲近的相处，这本身就让他感到满足。他珍惜的不只是自己藏在心里的感情，也珍惜两人现在还能自然相处的状态。正因为他知道，说出心意可能会改变这一切，所以眼前的美好反而让他有些舍不得轻易迈出那一步。有时他心里的喜欢会变得更强烈，但他还是没有把心意全部说出来。这不是他又开始犹豫，也不是他刚学会了如何克制自己，而是因为他既真心喜欢这个人，也同样珍惜两人现在的关系。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "01a306f1-0551-490a-b852-7cbfa88cdb0f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003000931808Z", "elapsed_seconds": 6.828, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:30:07.764447+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "995709c6989a920acd850b58220cd6e071930deb9384dc673afebac7bcb08393", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003000931808Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"